The X Factors — Commerce Foundation Pre-Assessment & Mark Scheme (Class 11 & 12)
===================================================================================

Assessment Overview: Time: 30 Mins | Total Marks: 50 Marks (5 Levels × 10 Marks each)

Five-Level Diagnostic Framework:
- Level 1 (10m) — Knowing the Names (Golden Rules): Real, Personal, Nominal classification
- Level 2 (10m) — The Two Sides of Business (Dual Aspect): Cash In vs Cash Out / Debit & Credit
- Level 3 (10m) — Calculating Basic Profit: Closing Capital (₹90,000) - Opening Capital (₹40,000) = ₹50,000 Profit
- Level 4 (10m) — What We Own vs What We Owe: Assets vs Liabilities
- Level 5 (10m) — The Accounting Equation Puzzle: Assets = Capital + Liabilities

Diagnostic Intervention Mapping:
- Level 1: Account Classification Vocabulary
- Level 2: Transaction Duality & Debit/Credit Intuition
- Level 3: Arithmetic & Net Profit Deductions
- Level 4: Balance Sheet Intuition
- Level 5: Accounting Equation Algebra
